{"availability":"available","full":"rim-19/job_search","name":"job_search","description":"Automated job-search agent — collects remote dev roles from job APIs, RSS feeds, and ~80 startup boards, scores each against a CV with Gemini (1-10 + summary), dedupes and stores in SQLite, and publishes a GitHub Pages dashboard on a schedule via GitHub Actions.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-09T17:46:00Z","updated":"2026-10-10T05:44:22Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://rim-19.github.io/job_search/","topics":["ai","automation","ci-cd","gemini","github-actions","github-pages","job-search","playwright","python","rss","sqlite","telegram-bot","web-scraping"],"demo":"https://rim-19.github.io/job_search/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:13.145Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:13.145Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:13.145Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:04:13.145Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A $0-cost automated agent that runs every 5 hours (so you're an early applicant):","Search profile: junior · remote, tech stack from the CV (Python, JS/TS, React, Next.js, Node, HTML/CSS, Java, C#, AI/LLM/NLP). Based in Morocco (UTC+0/+1), so the AI treats worldwide, Europe/EMEA, Africa/MENA, GMT/CET-timezone, and Employer-of-Record / international-contractor roles as good matches — and only rejects roles that genuinely exclude her (US/Canada-only work authorization, Americas/APAC-locked, onsite/hybrid)."],"features":["Collects remote dev jobs from many free sources — 5 JSON APIs (Remotive, Arbeitnow, RemoteOK, Jobicy, Himalayas), The Muse and Landing.jobs APIs, RSS feeds (Jobicy, WeWorkRemotely, Jobspresso, Remote Woman, Authentic…","Dedupes within the run by (title + company + url), and across runs via the database — a later run never re-surfaces what an earlier one already showed.","Filters — a rule-based location filter drops obviously country-locked roles (US only, hybrid, onsite…), then Gemini reads each description and returns a score 1–10, a one-line reason, and a 2–3 sentence summary —…","Flags recency — every listing gets dayssinceposted and a Fresh label (≤ 7 days). Nothing is ever discarded; Fresh listings just sort first, older ones show muted with a \"posted X days ago\" caption.","Stores everything in SQLite (data/jobs.db, the source of truth) and exports docs/jobs.json."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/rim-19/job_search/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b5c1c331b7b941be8fd87ebf48763cd4d7e143436aa21cb56d3877b93cb3ad21","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:13.229Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:13.229Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A $0-cost automated agent that runs every 5 hours (so you're an early applicant):","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/rim-19/job_search/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"b5c1c331b7b941be8fd87ebf48763cd4d7e143436aa21cb56d3877b93cb3ad21","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/rim-19/job_search/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:13.230Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T05:44:22Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/rim-19/job_search/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:13.230Z","hash":"b5c1c331b7b941be8fd87ebf48763cd4d7e143436aa21cb56d3877b93cb3ad21","originalBytes":5187,"storedBytes":5187,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["collectors","fresh","job","remote","apply","github","roles","search","apis","cover","days","each","feeds","only","outreach","rss","api","boards","company","first","gemini","jobs","kit","letter","muse","new","pages","posted","recruiter","runs","score","source","sources.py","sqlite","summary","agent","ago","alerts","ashby","button","card","cost","dashboard","data","docs","doesn","every","everything","filter","free","generation","good","google","greenhouse","hybrid","jobicy","jobs.db","jobs.js